WEBVTT

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:02.313
I don't think we want to go back to
"The Graduate" and, "One word: plastics."

00:12:02.337 --> 00:12:03.496
DB: Right.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:04.964
CA: Is there one word?

00:12:04.988 --> 00:12:09.126
What is the advice
that we should be giving?

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.934
DB: If I had to choose one word,
it would be "commitments."

00:12:11.958 --> 00:12:14.886
Now, we're not going to go back
to the deference to authority.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:17.224
But we can organize our lives
around commitments,

00:12:17.248 --> 00:12:20.826
the promises we make to each other
and being faithful to those promises.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:23.441
And most people graduating
from college or high school,

00:12:23.465 --> 00:12:25.437
in the 15 or 20 years after,

00:12:25.461 --> 00:12:28.179
they're going to make four
big commitments in their lives:

00:12:28.203 --> 00:12:29.543
to a spouse and family,

00:12:29.567 --> 00:12:30.954
to a vocation,